{"3606780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chunky JUMP!", "steam_appid": 3606780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/306d99edd1d3bc8a44906a6a4da2ac3e.apng?t=1786940092\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/306d99edd1d3bc8a44906a6a4da2ac3e.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" class=\"bb_img\" width=840 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/8cadb0bf876045bfd919907bdb3bb8a2.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/8cadb0bf876045bfd919907bdb3bb8a2.webm?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/8cadb0bf876045bfd919907bdb3bb8a2.mp4?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By day,</strong> you run a small gas station in Carrot Town, serving quirky citizens, fulfilling strange requests, and keeping your promise. <strong>By night,</strong> the power goes out, and something terrifying begins to move in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the vents. Peek through the windows. Stay on guard… all while sneaking in a round of Chunky JUMP! on your trusty BIRD BOY console.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/f6fe388a676a673d9133f74d95606dc1.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/f6fe388a676a673d9133f74d95606dc1.webm?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/f6fe388a676a673d9133f74d95606dc1.mp4?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>roguelike-inspired mode</strong> where you play through randomized levels, nights, and minigames. Push your run as far as possible, earn miles or <strong><i>DIAL-A-RIVAL</i></strong> to unlock crossover rivals from other worlds (such as <strong><i>The Bunny Graveyard, Garten of Banban, Indigo Park, Among Us </i></strong>and many more). But be careful, if you lose, you'll have to start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE PLAY MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/0f4b78b2b7b80b4a70f8d6fada8c5431.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/0f4b78b2b7b80b4a70f8d6fada8c5431.webm?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/0f4b78b2b7b80b4a70f8d6fada8c5431.mp4?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your favorite <strong>levels, nights, and minigames</strong>, compete against your ghost, chase high scores on the <strong>online leaderboards</strong>, and enjoy Anky's completely unnecessary insults.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated <strong>CUTSCENES</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong> and test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong> skins for Chunky and meet some new and familiar faces...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your BIRD BOY with different colors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong> On the online leaderboards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/306d99edd1d3bc8a44906a6a4da2ac3e.apng?t=1786940092\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/306d99edd1d3bc8a44906a6a4da2ac3e.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" class=\"bb_img\" width=840 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/8cadb0bf876045bfd919907bdb3bb8a2.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/8cadb0bf876045bfd919907bdb3bb8a2.webm?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/8cadb0bf876045bfd919907bdb3bb8a2.mp4?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By day,</strong> you run a small gas station in Carrot Town, serving quirky citizens, fulfilling strange requests, and keeping your promise. <strong>By night,</strong> the power goes out, and something terrifying begins to move in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the vents. Peek through the windows. Stay on guard… all while sneaking in a round of Chunky JUMP! on your trusty BIRD BOY console.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/f6fe388a676a673d9133f74d95606dc1.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/f6fe388a676a673d9133f74d95606dc1.webm?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/f6fe388a676a673d9133f74d95606dc1.mp4?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>roguelike-inspired mode</strong> where you play through randomized levels, nights, and minigames. Push your run as far as possible, earn miles or <strong><i>DIAL-A-RIVAL</i></strong> to unlock crossover rivals from other worlds (such as <strong><i>The Bunny Graveyard, Garten of Banban, Indigo Park, Among Us </i></strong>and many more). But be careful, if you lose, you'll have to start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE PLAY MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/0f4b78b2b7b80b4a70f8d6fada8c5431.poster.avif?t=1786940092\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/0f4b78b2b7b80b4a70f8d6fada8c5431.webm?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/0f4b78b2b7b80b4a70f8d6fada8c5431.mp4?t=1786940092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your favorite <strong>levels, nights, and minigames</strong>, compete against your ghost, chase high scores on the <strong>online leaderboards</strong>, and enjoy Anky's completely unnecessary insults.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated <strong>CUTSCENES</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong> and test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong> skins for Chunky and meet some new and familiar faces...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your BIRD BOY with different colors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong> On the online leaderboards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Chunky JUMP! is a survival-horror platformer where you must survive through the night on your BIRD BOY. But beware... the Ghabbit is hunting, and you must restore the gas station's power before it's too late!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/afd8de28f6679282f2d6434de9e52b6832398bfb/header.jpg?t=1786940092", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/2569fec03bbe40417663a7fabe09de7e9e9ad9ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786940092", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/2569fec03bbe40417663a7fabe09de7e9e9ad9ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786940092", "website": "htt